#: src/qml/PlayerPage.qml:99
msgctxt "@info %2 is the name of a distribution"
msgid ""
"Dragon Player only supports the QtMultimedia library’s “ffmpeg” backend, but "
"a different one is currently in use.\n"
"<nl/><nl/>\n"
"Please <link url=\"%1\">contact the %2 developers</link> about this issue."
msgstr ""
"Dragon Player støttar bare «ffmpeg»-motoren i QtMultimedia-biblioteket, men "
"nå er en annen i bruk.\n"
"<nl/><nl/>\n"
"<link url=\"%1\">Meld fra til %2-utviklerne</link> om problemet."

#: src/qml/PlayerPage.qml:108
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Not all video codecs are installed. Video playback support may be less "
"reliable than expected.\n"
"Please install codecs-extra by running:\n"
"<para><command>flatpak install org.freedesktop.Platform.codecs-extra//25.08-"
"extra</command></para>"
msgstr ""
"Ikke alle videokodekene er installert. Støtte for videoavspilling kan derfor "
"være mindre pålitelig enn forventet.\n"
"Installer «codecs-extra» ved å kjøre:\n"
"<para><command>flatpak install org.freedesktop.Platform.codecs-extra//25.08-"
"extra</command></para>"

#: src/qml/PlayerPage.qml:115
msgctxt "@info %2 is the name of a distribution"
msgid ""
"Could not locate full support for the H.264 video codec; video playback "
"support may be less reliable than expected.\n"
"<nl/><nl/>\n"
"Please <link url=\"%1\">contact the %2 developers</link> about this issue, "
"or to find out how to install the missing video codecs."
msgstr ""
"Fant ikke full støtte for videokodeken H.264. Støtte for videoavspilling kan "
"derfor være mindre pålitelig enn forventet.\n"
"<nl/><nl/>\n"
"<link url=\"%1\">Meld fra til %2-utviklerne</link> om problemet, eller ta "
"kontakt med dem for å finne ut hvordan du installerer de manglende "
"videokodekene."

#: src/qml/PlayerPage.qml:401
msgctxt ""
"@info overlay on top of video. %1 is the amount of time played %2 is the "
"total duration of the video"
msgid "%1 / %2"
msgstr "%1 / %2"

